mpg123 is under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1, below.
It is the unmodified build of MSYS2's mingw-w64-x86_64-mpg123 package, in its
own DLL, libmpg123-0.dll, which you may replace with a build of your own.
Its source is available from https://www.mpg123.de/ and the recipe it was
built with from https://github.com/msys2/MINGW-packages .
